00_Afz5fwNLWt7v_UO1d1fTIrm03utWs9KX3tQpxqi3nPTnwA&oe=69B938D7"}, "display_name": "Dragon Fist: VR Kung Fu", "keywords": ["fighting", "kungfu", "physics", "boxing", "simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n{1194756028402406}\n# **The Legend Begins...**\nA ruthless master rises. Vengeful emperors scheme. Peasants sharpen their blades. They all have something to prove\u2014and only one path forward: **Kung Fu.**\n\n{1903052986827168}\n# **Step Into Your Own Kung Fu Movie**\nYou\u2019re not watching a Kung Fu movie\u2014you\u2019re in it. Dragon Fist delivers fast-paced melee combat powered by physics and real martial arts.\n\n{808577998151364}\n# **Hone in Your Skills**\nPractice strikes, blocks, dodges, and combos. There is an endless amount of combat to explore.\n\n{354077967776881}\n# **Play Your Way**\n- Campaign\n- Multiplayer (up to 8)\n- Co-op Campaign\n- Training\n- and More...\n\n=========================\n\n# New DLC: Midnight Alley\n\nTake the fight to the streets! Midnight Alley contains a new environment for single and multiplayer modes, and 3 new characters.\n\n- **New Environment - The Alley:** A narrow streetside area lit by lanterns, windows and the moon. Features breakable doors that allow you to enter side buildings.\n- **3 New Characters:** Play as The Landlady, The Centipede, and White Eagle, each with their own perks, weaknesses, and special moves.", "short_description": "Step into your own Kung Fu Movie! This first-person Kung Fu fighter with stylized graphics, physics-based combat, and multiplayer pays homage to the golden era of martial arts films. Play with up to 8 friends in multiplayer modes like Co-Op, PvP, Challenges, or take on an expansive singleplayer campaign. "}]}, "developer_name": "Ben Olding Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://c